To add availability to the existing session class, you can modify the addSlot() method to accept an additional parameter for availability. You can use a nested Map to store the availability count for each session window within an appointment type.

Here's an example implementation of the modified Session class:
```kotlin
class Session {
  constructor(date) {
    this.date = date;
    this.sessionWindowMapWithSlots = new Map();
    this.appointmentTypeMapWithSessionWindowCount = new Map();
    this.appointmentTypeMapWithAvailability = new Map();
  }

  addSlot(sessionWindow, slot, availability) {
    if (!["6AM-9AM", "9AM-12PM", "12PM-3PM", "3PM-6PM", "6PM-9PM", "9PM-12AM", "12AM-3AM", "3AM-6AM"].includes(sessionWindow)) {
      ThrowError.throwBadRequestError(new dFramework.ErrorPath("sessionWindow", `Invalid session window: ${sessionWindow}`));
    }

    if (!this.sessionWindowMapWithSlots.has(sessionWindow)) {
      this.sessionWindowMapWithSlots.set(sessionWindow, new Map());
    }

    const nestedMap = this.sessionWindowMapWithSlots.get(sessionWindow);
    if (!nestedMap.has(slot.type)) {
      nestedMap.set(slot.type, []);
    }
    nestedMap.get(slot.type).push(slot);

    this.sessionWindowMapWithSlots.set(sessionWindow, nestedMap);

    // Update appointment type map with session window count
    if (!this.appointmentTypeMapWithSessionWindowCount.has(slot.type)) {
      this.appointmentTypeMapWithSessionWindowCount.set(slot.type, new Map());
    }

    const sessionWindowCountMap = this.appointmentTypeMapWithSessionWindowCount.get(slot.type);
    if (!sessionWindowCountMap.has(sessionWindow)) {
      sessionWindowCountMap.set(sessionWindow, 0);
    }
    sessionWindowCountMap.set(sessionWindow, sessionWindowCountMap.get(sessionWindow) + 1);

    this.appointmentTypeMapWithSessionWindowCount.set(slot.type, sessionWindowCountMap);

    // Update appointment type map with availability count
    if (!this.appointmentTypeMapWithAvailability.has(slot.type)) {
      this.appointmentTypeMapWithAvailability.set(slot.type, new Map());
    }

    const sessionWindowAvailabilityMap = this.appointmentTypeMapWithAvailability.get(slot.type);
    if (!sessionWindowAvailabilityMap.has(sessionWindow)) {
      sessionWindowAvailabilityMap.set(sessionWindow, 0);
    }
    sessionWindowAvailabilityMap.set(sessionWindow, sessionWindowAvailabilityMap.get(sessionWindow) + availability);

    this.appointmentTypeMapWithAvailability.set(slot.type, sessionWindowAvailabilityMap);
  }
}
```
